  "Solution": {
    "S": "Step 1: Hinsberg's reagent is benzene sulphonyl chloride.\n\nIts formula is $\\mathrm{C_6H_5SO_2Cl}$.\n\nStep 2: It is used in the Hinsberg test to distinguish between primary, secondary, and tertiary amines.\n\nFinal Answer: $$\\boxed{\\text{benzene sulphonyl chloride}}$$\n\nHence, the correct option is B."
